he Amazon fires have reminded the world  of the importance of preserving the  region but they're just another  consequence of the uncontrolled  unremitting more gradual destruction  being wrought in the interest of  development at the expense of this land  and the people who live here then you  swim their outer zerah carry Puna or on  dawnia's state northwestern Brazil
 

